# Generated Docs Directory

## Purpose

Holds generated documentation artifacts produced by scripts. Files in this folder are generated outputs and should not be hand-edited unless explicitly noted.

## Rules

- Regenerate files using their source scripts instead of manual edits.
- For special function-icon outputs, regenerate with:
  - `npm run scan:special-function-icons`
  - or incremental: `npm run scan:special-function-icons:incremental -- --files=<file.webp>`
- Keep questionable-card reporting intact so review can happen before data migrations are finalized.
